{"schemaVersion":1,"id":19,"sections":[{"id":"110004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[600],"start":0,"count":12},{"id":"110004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10590],"start":12,"count":13},{"id":"110005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[610],"start":25,"count":10},{"id":"110005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10600],"start":35,"count":9},{"id":"110006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[620],"start":44,"count":7},{"id":"110006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10610],"start":51,"count":10}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:2","scriptId":600,"text":"黎明时分，到了该出发的时间。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:3","scriptId":600,"text":"“长官该起床了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:4","scriptId":600,"text":"我打了个哈欠，收起盖在身上的军用毛毯。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:5","scriptId":600,"text":"由于帐篷确实太小了，所以整个晚上我就在吉普车上凑合了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:6","scriptId":600,"text":"“哟，今天起得很早啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:7","scriptId":600,"text":"“是你起得晚啦，大家都在做准备了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:8","scriptId":600,"text":"望了望四周，帐篷都已经收整完毕，看到奈乐她们正在分配源奶。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:9","scriptId":600,"text":"“长官不来一瓶源奶吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:10","scriptId":600,"text":"“源奶？那是钢舞姬专用的……还是给我来个罐头吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:11","scriptId":600,"text":"“味道和普通牛奶没什么区别的说。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:12","scriptId":600,"text":"“有大量的儿茶酚胺和安非他命混合在里面，人类心脏是受不了的啦，笨蛋佐伊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":41,"right":81,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-PROLOGUE:600:13","scriptId":600,"text":"“额……胺酚什么的？？好吧，我忘了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":40,"right":81,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:1","scriptId":10590,"text":"过了下坡后，顺手清理掉了路上的战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":40,"right":81,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":249,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:2","scriptId":10590,"text":"“说起来已经好久没执行这样轻松愉快的任务了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":249,"right":81,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":242,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:3","scriptId":10590,"text":"“雷娅不要太放松，战场可容不得半点大意。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":249,"right":242,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":249,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:4","scriptId":10590,"text":"“安啦～我会注意的～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":249,"right":242,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":235,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:5","scriptId":10590,"text":"“不过话说回来，这次任务是个搜索任务吧，好像太兴师动众了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":249,"right":235,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:6","scriptId":10590,"text":"“我们这边的任务是援护侦察部队，至于搜索什么，我兴趣不大。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":235,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":235,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:7","scriptId":10590,"text":"“也对，而且还遇到了普莉玛，世界真是小啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":235,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:8","scriptId":10590,"text":"“是啊，‘爱哭鬼’普莉玛那胆小的性格，我还以为她这辈子都不能从学院毕业了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":235,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:9","scriptId":10590,"text":"两人对话的时候，莉娜蹲在一边的角落里偷听。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":235,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:10","scriptId":10590,"text":"（嘻嘻嘻～收集八卦我最喜欢～）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":87,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:11","scriptId":10590,"text":"（原来普莉玛还有‘爱哭鬼’这种绰号啊～，我得记下来～）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":87,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":237,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:12","scriptId":10590,"text":"“我说莉娜，你这隐蔽也太差了，偷听我们的对话还以为不会被发现吗～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":237,"right":87,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":86,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110004-EPILOGUE:10590:13","scriptId":10590,"text":"“我错了～饶命啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":237,"right":86,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:2","scriptId":610,"text":"“这次的侦察任务有沙狐小队做后援真是太好了，万一再遇到那个怪物应该不至于输得那么惨了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":86,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:3","scriptId":610,"text":"“父亲的文件里提到的那个人形不明生物是吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:4","scriptId":610,"text":"“不觉得惊讶吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:5","scriptId":610,"text":"“有点，我们在北非的时候也遇到过类似的不明生物。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:6","scriptId":610,"text":"“哦！？那结果怎么样？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:7","scriptId":610,"text":"“结果，结果就是没有结果，还没有发生交火那个东西就消失得无影无踪了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:8","scriptId":610,"text":"“诶！？那你们汇报给死水上层了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:9","scriptId":610,"text":"“没有，那时候半信半疑，大家都以为看到了海市蜃楼，就不了了之。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:10","scriptId":610,"text":"“这次父亲文件里提到的不明生物和之前见到的很像，所以我们也很好奇，就算免费也要来探个究竟。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-PROLOGUE:610:11","scriptId":610,"text":"“原来是这样……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:1","scriptId":10600,"text":"“我们那次遇到的不明生物基本无视我们的任何攻击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:2","scriptId":10600,"text":"“你们攻击了她？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:3","scriptId":10600,"text":"“恩，正面攻击应该是无效的，使用了最大火力，但结果却是毫发无伤。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":86,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:4","scriptId":10600,"text":"“实在是太可怕了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":86,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:5","scriptId":10600,"text":"“不过好在她并没有来追我们，算是不幸中的万幸，不然还不知道会怎么样呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":86,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:6","scriptId":10600,"text":"“至少你们的攻击证明了敌人不是幻觉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:7","scriptId":10600,"text":"“听上去很强啊，看来是值得一战的对手。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":223,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":242,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:8","scriptId":10600,"text":"“我们这次主要任务是援护，不要做多余的事情！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":242,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110005-EPILOGUE:10600:9","scriptId":10600,"text":"“这个我当然知道啦～我只是说说而已嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":242,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110006-PROLOGUE:620:2","scriptId":620,"text":"从地图上看，附近有一个中继站的标志，不知道能不能弄到点补给物资。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":242,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-PROLOGUE:620:3","scriptId":620,"text":"“如果能弄到点面包之类的就好了，罐头味道太差了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":242,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-PROLOGUE:620:4","scriptId":620,"text":"“恩，顺便可以补充一下弹药物资。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-PROLOGUE:620:5","scriptId":620,"text":"“是啊，战车兽清理了那么多，弹药都快打光了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110006-PROLOGUE:620:6","scriptId":620,"text":"于是顺着地图的路线来到了中继站。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":103,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-PROLOGUE:620:7","scriptId":620,"text":"“一个不好的消息……中继站已经被战车兽占领了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":31,"right":81,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-PROLOGUE:620:8","scriptId":620,"text":"“那就去夺回来。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":81,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":44,"speaker":"金属战龟","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:2","scriptId":10610,"text":"“…………”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":44,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:4","scriptId":10610,"text":"终于放倒了占领中继站的战车兽群。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":null,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:5","scriptId":10610,"text":"“辛苦了，刚才的战斗中好像出现了未确认的战车兽？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:6","scriptId":10610,"text":"“恩，象龟型的，体型好大。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":31,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:7","scriptId":10610,"text":"“未确认型的战车兽，这种大乌龟也是新品种啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":31,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:8","scriptId":10610,"text":"“对，和我们在北非遇到骆驼型的情形差不多。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":247,"right":223,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:9","scriptId":10610,"text":"“还有骆驼型啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":41,"right":223,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:10","scriptId":10610,"text":"“恩，不限于已经出现过的战车兽，像这样偶尔还会出现一些新品种，但是这种情况的发生原因始终是个不解之谜。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":41,"right":223,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":235,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:11","scriptId":10610,"text":"“当时也还是挺惊讶的，不过现在已经习惯了新品种的突然出现。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":235,"right":223,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":235,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"110006-EPILOGUE:10610:12","scriptId":10610,"text":"“按平常心应对就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":235,"right":223,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["看情况，应该还有一两天的路程就能到达齐格菲研究所了。","原来人形不明生物早就已经被发现过了啊……","一路上打打战车兽，大家聊聊天，有了沙狐小队的支援，确实比之前轻松太多了。"]}
